<p>New York City Mayor Zohran Mamdani met President Donald Trump in the Oval Office for a second time, pressing for federal backing for a $21 billion housing plan. They also discussed immigration. In a parallel development, Mamdani raised the detention of Columbia University student Ellie Aghayeva, an Azerbaijani national arrested by US Immigration and Customs Enforcement earlier the same day and later released, according to multiple outlets. Aghayeva said she was “safe and okay” but in “complete shock,” and coverage noted she has not been publicly linked to the pro-Palestinian campus protests that previously drew attention at Columbia. The Straits Times said Mamdani walked away with “two unexpected victories”: Aghayeva’s release and momentum for his housing push.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/OcYdyzG_tofMHUQEK8MtiyqS48LeUB8Btb2hYrIucQZlKS8jZWOsBC0abhOvNLDVs98aQtJSZDWcXyqK3j2gDV7CiKCYSR0wr0xcElkTW86kt_QfNJkizd3Wsgn-kVgmJ_Uo6KGYBzc3ShmLA1dZ7dLqn6yRZuXJSnEteA0V_2PyY3f79_9H9BpqD_wh7mSycaFhK21RD8ZoTy5ShQCwK0wImbioYvD81Vqx7hYe5sNGvwk' alt='New York City Mayor Zohran Mamdani and President Donald Trump meet at the White House.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Visual prop: Mamdani brought a mock New York Daily News front page to the White House to underscore his pitch for federal housing support.</li><li>Timing/criticism: World Socialist Web Site said the second Oval Office meeting came less than two days after Trump’s State of the Union address and cast it as deepening Mamdani’s collaboration with the president.</li><li>Aghayeva background: NDTV described the Columbia student as an Azerbaijani senior studying neuroscience and politics.</li><li>DW framing: Deutsche Welle highlighted what it called a “rollercoaster” — ICE detained Aghayeva, then released her after Mamdani raised the case with Trump.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Financial Times: The outlet framed the second Oval Office meeting as signaling a growing partnership between Mayor Mamdani and President Trump, with housing and immigration on the agenda. (<a href='https://www.ft.com/content/67b10faa-21c0-47ea-b396-e147a4c8c589'>Financial Times</a>)</li><li>World Socialist Web Site: The outlet argued Mamdani is deepening collaboration with President Trump and criticized the meeting’s timing in relation to Trump’s State of the Union address. (<a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/02/27/mfdq-f27.html'>World Socialist Web Site</a>)</li><li>Deutsche Welle: The outlet highlighted the “rollercoaster” sequence in which Aghayeva was detained by ICE and then released after Mamdani raised the issue with President Trump. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/us-detained-student-released-after-mamdani-meets-trump/a-76143762'>Deutsche Welle</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/zohran-mamdani-shows-donald-trump-mock-newspaper-to-seek-21-billion-housing-support-11143742#publisher=newsstand'>Zohran Mamdani Shows Donald Trump Mock Newspaper To Seek $21 Billion Housing Support</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/02/27/mfdq-f27.html'>Mamdani deepens collaboration with Trump in second White House meeting</a> - wsws.org</li><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/67b10faa-21c0-47ea-b396-e147a4c8c589'>Trump and Mamdani discuss housing and immigration in second meeting</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/mamdani-meets-trump-in-white-house-for-second-time-pitches-housing-plans-with-mock-newspaper/article70682862.ece'>Mamdani meets Trump in White House for second time, pitches housing plans with mock newspaper</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/us-detained-student-released-after-mamdani-meets-trump/a-76143762'>US: Detained student released after Mamdani meets Trump</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/nyc-mayor-mamdani-meets-again-with-trump-emerging-with-two-unexpected-victories'>NYC mayor Mamdani meets again with Trump, emerging with two unexpected victories</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1rfn8iy/detained_columbia_student_released_after_mamdani/'>Detained Columbia student released after Mamdani talks with Trump | Columbia University</a> - reddit.com</li></ul>